  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold right-wing, conservative, or Republican political views in the United States. The meme is designed to appeal to those who are politically opposed to the Democratic Party and its prominent members (Ilhan Omar, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, Ayanna Pressley, Rashida Tlaib), by falsely attributing hateful and racist rhetoric to them. The use of Nancy Pelosi’s image, a well-known and often vilified figure among conservatives, serves as a visual anchor to signal that the meme is intended for those who perceive her as a symbol of Democratic extremism. The meme leverages existing political divisions and stereotypes (anti-white, anti-Jewish, anti-Christian, anti-conservative, anti-Republican) to incite fear, anger, and division among its intended audience, who are likely to be motivated by partisan animosity and a desire to delegitimize Democratic politicians. The formal setting (U.S. flag, microphone) is used to lend false credibility to the false claims, further appealing to audiences who value political authority and official narratives.",
